<!DOCTYPE reference PUBLIC "-//OASIS//DTD DITA Reference//EN" "reference.dtd">
<reference id="bacnet-BacnetConfigFolder" xml:lang="en" class="- topic/topic       reference/reference ">
<title class="- topic/title ">ConfigFolder</title>
<shortdesc class="- topic/shortdesc ">This component implements a folder under a BacnetConfigDeviceExt
(Config). </shortdesc>
<prolog class="- topic/prolog ">
<metadata class="- topic/metadata "><keywords class="- topic/keywords "><indexterm class="- topic/indexterm ">ConfigFolder</indexterm></keywords>
</metadata>
</prolog>
<refbody class="- topic/body        reference/refbody ">
<section class="- topic/section "><p class="- topic/p ">Typically, you add such folders using the <uicontrol class="+ topic/ph ui-d/uicontrol ">New
Folder</uicontrol> button in the <wintitle class="+ topic/keyword ui-d/wintitle ">Bacnet Config Manager</wintitle> view of the Config container. Each BacnetConfigFolder has its own <wintitle class="+ topic/keyword ui-d/wintitle ">Bacnet Config Manager</wintitle> view. </p></section>
</refbody>
</reference>